</div>
<div class="responsivegrid aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="image aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

    
    




    



</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div class="cmp-text" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-07ab0c2e05&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;aem-nfl-base/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-09-09T20:33:01Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;br>\r\nThe NFL returns for the 2026 season as Kickoff Weekend signals the start of a 272-game journey, one that promises hope for each of the league&#39;s 32 teams as they set their sights on Super Bowl LXI, which will be played on Sunday, February 14, 2027, at SoFi Stadium in Inglewood.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>For the 2026 NFL Kickoff Guide, &lt;a href=\&#34;http://media.nfl.com/content/dam/communications/media/publications/2026%20Kickoff%20Guide.pdf\&#34;>click here&lt;/a>. The sections include:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>2026 Season&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Season-Long Themes&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Season Openings&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Schedule Quirks&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Football Notes&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>New &amp;amp; Familiar Faces&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Super Bowl&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Where to Tune In&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-07ab0c2e05">
    <p><br />
The NFL returns for the 2026 season as Kickoff Weekend signals the start of a 272-game journey, one that promises hope for each of the league&#39;s 32 teams as they set their sights on Super Bowl LXI, which will be played on Sunday, February 14, 2027, at SoFi Stadium in Inglewood.</p>
<p>For the 2026 NFL Kickoff Guide, <a href="http://media.nfl.com/content/dam/communications/media/publications/2026%20Kickoff%20Guide.pdf">click here</a>. The sections include:</p>
<ul><li>2026 Season</li><li>Season-Long Themes</li><li>Season Openings</li><li>Schedule Quirks</li><li>Football Notes</li><li>New &amp; Familiar Faces</li><li>Super Bowl</li><li>Where to Tune In</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>

    
</div>
